\id TIT EN_ULT fixture
\usfm 3.0
\ide UTF-8
\h Titus
\toc1 The Letter of Paul to Titus
\toc2 Titus
\toc3 Tit
\mt1 Titus

\ts\*
\c 1
\p
\v 1 Paul, a servant of God and an apostle of Jesus Christ.
\v 2 in the hope of eternal life, which God, who does not lie, promised.
\ts\*
\p
\v 3 and at the proper time he revealed his word through the proclamation.
\v 4 to Titus, a true son in a shared faith.

\c 2
\p
\v 1-2 But you, speak what fits sound teaching; older men must be temperate.
\ts\*
\p
\v 3 Older women likewise must be reverent in behavior.

\c 3
\p
\v 1 Remind them to be subject to rulers and authorities.
\v 2 to speak evil of no one, to be peaceable, gentle.
